                                <TabsContent key={tabConfig[activeTab].key} value="variants">                                                                        onClick={() => removeVariant(index)}

                                    <motion.div                                                                    >

                                        key={tabConfig[activeTab].contentKey}                                                                        Remove

                                        initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }}                                                                    </Button>

                                        animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}                                                                )}

                                        exit={{ opacity: 0, y: -20 }}                                                            </div>

                                        transition={{ duration: 0.3 }}                                                        </CardHeader>

                                    >                                                        <CardContent className="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">

                                        <ScrollArea className="h-[500px] pr-4">                                                            <div className="space-y-2">

                                            <div className="space-y-4">                                                                <Label htmlFor={`weight-${index}`}>Weight</Label>

                                                {formData.variants.map((variant, index) => (                                                                <Input

                                                    <Card key={index} className="relative">                                                                    type="text"

                                                        <CardHeader className="pb-4">                                                                    id={`weight-${index}`}

                                                            <div className="flex justify-between items-center">                                                                    value={variant.weight}

                                                                <CardTitle className="text-lg">                                                                    onChange={(e) => handleVariantChange(index, 'weight', e.target.value)}

                                                                    Variant {index + 1}                                                                    placeholder="e.g., 250g"

                                                                </CardTitle>                                                                />

                                                                {formData.variants.length > 1 && (                                                            </div>

                                                                    <Button                                                            <div className="space-y-2">

                                                                        type="button"                                                                <Label htmlFor={`price-${index}`}>Price</Label>

                                                                        variant="destructive"                                                                <Input

                                                                        size="sm"                                                                    type="number"

                                                                        onClick={() => removeVariant(index)}                                                                    id={`price-${index}`}

                                                                    >                                                                    value={variant.price}

                                                                        Remove                                                                    onChange={(e) => handleVariantChange(index, 'price', e.target.value)}

                                                                    </Button>                                                                    placeholder="e.g., 199"

                                                                )}                                                                />

                                                            </div>                                                            </div>

                                                        </CardHeader>                                                            <div className="space-y-2">

                                                        <CardContent className="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">                                                                <Label htmlFor={`stock-${index}`}>Stock</Label>

                                                            <div className="space-y-2">                                                                <Input

                                                                <Label htmlFor={`weight-${index}`}>Weight</Label>                                                                    type="number"

                                                                <Input                                                                    id={`stock-${index}`}

                                                                    type="text"                                                                    value={variant.stock}

                                                                    id={`weight-${index}`}                                                                    onChange={(e) => handleVariantChange(index, 'stock', e.target.value)}

                                                                    value={variant.weight}                                                                    placeholder="e.g., 100"

                                                                    onChange={(e) => handleVariantChange(index, 'weight', e.target.value)}                                                                />

                                                                    placeholder="e.g., 250g"                                                            </div>

                                                                />                                                        </CardContent>

                                                            </div>                                                    </Card>

                                                            <div className="space-y-2">                                                ))}

                                                                <Label htmlFor={`price-${index}`}>Price</Label>                                            </div>

                                                                <Input                                        </ScrollArea>

                                                                    type="number"

                                                                    id={`price-${index}`}                                        <Button

                                                                    value={variant.price}                                            type="button"

                                                                    onChange={(e) => handleVariantChange(index, 'price', e.target.value)}                                            onClick={addVariant}

                                                                    placeholder="e.g., 199"                                            className="mt-4 w-full"

                                                                />                                            variant="outline"

                                                            </div>                                        >

                                                            <div className="space-y-2">                                            Add Another Variant

                                                                <Label htmlFor={`stock-${index}`}>Stock</Label>                                        </Button>

                                                                <Input                                    </motion.div>

                                                                    type="number"                                </TabsContent>

                                                                    id={`stock-${index}`}

                                                                    value={variant.stock}                                <TabsContent key="review" value="review">

                                                                    onChange={(e) => handleVariantChange(index, 'stock', e.target.value)}                                    <motion.div

                                                                    placeholder="e.g., 100"                                        initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }}

                                                                />                                        animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}

                                                            </div>                                        exit={{ opacity: 0, y: -20 }}

                                                        </CardContent>                                        transition={{ duration: 0.3 }}

                                                    </Card>                                    >

                                                ))}                                        <Card>

                                            </div>                                            <CardHeader>

                                        </ScrollArea>                                                <CardTitle>Product Summary</CardTitle>

                                                <CardDescription>Review your product details before submission</CardDescription>

                                        <Button                                            </CardHeader>

                                            type="button"                                            <CardContent className="space-y-6">

                                            onClick={addVariant}                                                <div className="space-y-2">

                                            className="mt-4 w-full"                                                    <h3 className="font-medium">Basic Information</h3>

                                            variant="outline"                                                    <div className="grid gap-2">

                                        >                                                        <div className="flex justify-between py-1 border-b">

                                            Add Another Variant                                                            <span className="text-muted-foreground">Category:</span>

                                        </Button>                                                            <Badge variant="outline">{formData.category || 'Not set'}</Badge>

                                    </motion.div>                                                        </div>

                                </TabsContent>                                                        <div className="flex justify-between py-1 border-b">

                                                            <span className="text-muted-foreground">Title:</span>

                                <TabsContent key={tabConfig[activeTab].key} value="review">                                                            <span className="font-medium">{formData.product_title || 'Not set'}</span>

                                    <motion.div                                                        </div>

                                        key={tabConfig[activeTab].contentKey}                                                        <div className="flex justify-between py-1 border-b">

                                        initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }}                                                            <span className="text-muted-foreground">Reference Name:</span>

                                        animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}                                                            <span>{formData.product_name || 'Not set'}</span>

                                        exit={{ opacity: 0, y: -20 }}                                                        </div>

                                        transition={{ duration: 0.3 }}                                                    </div>

                                    >                                                </div>

                                        <Card>

                                            <CardHeader>                                                <div className="space-y-2">

                                                <CardTitle>Product Summary</CardTitle>                                                    <h3 className="font-medium">Images</h3>

                                                <CardDescription>Review your product details before submission</CardDescription>                                                    <div className="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4">

                                            </CardHeader>                                                        {[1, 2, 3].map((num) => (

                                            <CardContent className="space-y-6">                                                            <div key={num} className="aspect-square rounded-lg border bg-muted relative">

                                                <div className="space-y-2">                                                                {imagePreviews[`product_image${num}`] ? (

                                                    <h3 className="font-medium">Basic Information</h3>                                                                    <img 

                                                    <div className="grid gap-2">                                                                        src={imagePreviews[`product_image${num}`]}

                                                        <div className="flex justify-between py-1 border-b">                                                                        alt={`Preview ${num}`}

                                                            <span className="text-muted-foreground">Category:</span>                                                                        className="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-lg"

                                                            <Badge variant="outline">{formData.category || 'Not set'}</Badge>                                                                    />

                                                        </div>                                                                ) : (

                                                        <div className="flex justify-between py-1 border-b">                                                                    <div className="flex items-center justify-center h-full">

                                                            <span className="text-muted-foreground">Title:</span>                                                                        <span className="text-sm text-muted-foreground">No image</span>

                                                            <span className="font-medium">{formData.product_title || 'Not set'}</span>                                                                    </div>

                                                        </div>                                                                )}

                                                        <div className="flex justify-between py-1 border-b">                                                            </div>

                                                            <span className="text-muted-foreground">Reference Name:</span>                                                        ))}

                                                            <span>{formData.product_name || 'Not set'}</span>                                                    </div>

                                                        </div>                                                </div>

                                                    </div>

                                                </div>                                                <div className="space-y-2">

                                                    <h3 className="font-medium">Variants ({formData.variants.length})</h3>

                                                <div className="space-y-2">                                                    <div className="grid gap-2">

                                                    <h3 className="font-medium">Images</h3>                                                        {formData.variants.map((variant, index) => (

                                                    <div className="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4">                                                            <div key={index} className="p-2 border rounded-lg">

                                                        {[1, 2, 3].map((num) => (                                                                <div className="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4">

                                                            <div key={num} className="aspect-square rounded-lg border bg-muted relative">                                                                    <div className="text-sm">

                                                                {imagePreviews[`product_image${num}`] ? (                                                                        <span className="text-muted-foreground">Weight:</span>{' '}

                                                                    <img                                                                         {variant.weight || 'Not set'}

                                                                        src={imagePreviews[`product_image${num}`]}                                                                    </div>

                                                                        alt={`Preview ${num}`}                                                                    <div className="text-sm">

                                                                        className="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-lg"                                                                        <span className="text-muted-foreground">Price:</span>{' '}

                                                                    />                                                                        {variant.price || 'Not set'}

                                                                ) : (                                                                    </div>

                                                                    <div className="flex items-center justify-center h-full">                                                                    <div className="text-sm">

                                                                        <span className="text-sm text-muted-foreground">No image</span>                                                                        <span className="text-muted-foreground">Stock:</span>{' '}

                                                                    </div>                                                                        {variant.stock || 'Not set'}

                                                                )}                                                                    </div>

                                                            </div>                                                                </div>

                                                        ))}                                                            </div>

                                                    </div>                                                        ))}

                                                </div>                                                    </div>

                                                </div>

                                                <div className="space-y-2">                                            </CardContent>

                                                    <h3 className="font-medium">Variants ({formData.variants.length})</h3>                                        </Card>

                                                    <div className="grid gap-2">                                    </motion.div>

                                                        {formData.variants.map((variant, index) => (                                </TabsContent>

                                                            <div key={index} className="p-2 border rounded-lg">                            </AnimatePresence>

                                                                <div className="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4">                        </div>

                                                                    <div className="text-sm">                    </Tabs>

                                                                        <span className="text-muted-foreground">Weight:</span>{' '}                </CardContent>

                                                                        {variant.weight || 'Not set'}                <CardFooter className="flex justify-between">

                                                                    </div>                    <Button

                                                                    <div className="text-sm">                        type="button"

                                                                        <span className="text-muted-foreground">Price:</span>{' '}                        variant="outline"

                                                                        {variant.price || 'Not set'}                        onClick={() => {

                                                                    </div>                            const tabs = ['basic', 'images', 'variants', 'review'];

                                                                    <div className="text-sm">                            const currentIndex = tabs.indexOf(activeTab);

                                                                        <span className="text-muted-foreground">Stock:</span>{' '}                            if (currentIndex > 0) {

                                                                        {variant.stock || 'Not set'}                                setActiveTab(tabs[currentIndex - 1]);

                                                                    </div>                            }

                                                                </div>                        }}

                                                            </div>                        disabled={activeTab === 'basic'}

                                                        ))}                    >

                                                    </div>                        Previous

                                                </div>                    </Button>

                                            </CardContent>

                                        </Card>                    {activeTab === 'review' ? (

                                    </motion.div>                        <Button

                                </TabsContent>                            type="submit"

                            </AnimatePresence>                            disabled={loading}

                        </div>                            className="bg-gradient-to-r from-secondary to-primary text-primary-foreground hover:opacity-90"

                    </Tabs>                        >

                </CardContent>                            {loading ? (

                <CardFooter className="flex justify-between">                                <>

                    <Button                                    <Loader2 className="mr-2 h-4 w-4 animate-spin" />

                        type="button"                                    Adding Product...

                        variant="outline"                                </>

                        onClick={() => {                            ) : (

                            const tabs = ['basic', 'images', 'variants', 'review'];                                'Add Product'

                            const currentIndex = tabs.indexOf(activeTab);                            )}

                            if (currentIndex > 0) {                        </Button>

                                setActiveTab(tabs[currentIndex - 1]);                    ) : (

                            }                        <Button

                        }}                            type="button"

                        disabled={activeTab === 'basic'}                            onClick={() => {

                    >                                const tabs = ['basic', 'images', 'variants', 'review'];

                        Previous                                const currentIndex = tabs.indexOf(activeTab);

                    </Button>                                if (currentIndex < tabs.length - 1) {

                                    setActiveTab(tabs[currentIndex + 1]);

                    {activeTab === 'review' ? (                                }

                        <Button                            }}

                            type="submit"                        >

                            disabled={loading}                            Next

                            className="bg-gradient-to-r from-secondary to-primary text-primary-foreground hover:opacity-90"                        </Button>

                        >                    )}

                            {loading ? (                </CardFooter>

                                <>            </Card>

                                    <Loader2 className="mr-2 h-4 w-4 animate-spin" />        </form>

                                    Adding Product...    );

                                </>};
                            ) : (
                                'Add Product'
                            )}
                        </Button>
                    ) : (
                        <Button
                            type="button"
                            onClick={() => {
                                const tabs = ['basic', 'images', 'variants', 'review'];
                                const currentIndex = tabs.indexOf(activeTab);
                                if (currentIndex < tabs.length - 1) {
                                    setActiveTab(tabs[currentIndex + 1]);
                                }
                            }}
                        >
                            Next
                        </Button>
                    )}
                </CardFooter>
            </Card>
        </form>
    );
};